  description: '2 Level 2 monsters

    You can detach 1 material from this card;
    add 1 "Melffy" card from your Deck to your hand. If another face-up "Melffy"
    monster you control returns to your hand (except during the Damage Step): You
    can target 1 face-up monster your opponent controls; it cannot attack, also its
    effects are negated while it is face-up on the field. You can only use each effect
    of "Melffy of the Forest" once per turn.'
